{
  "_comment": "Tier-2 corpus: real Project Gutenberg epubs, committed under corpus/epub/ and fetched by scripts/fetch-corpus.sh when one is added. Chosen for diversity rather than fame — multiple scripts and languages, very long and very short, diacritics and non-Latin characters in titles and author names, multiple authors, and works with no author at all. `sha256` is filled in by `scripts/fetch-corpus.sh --record`; once set it is verified on every fetch, so a Gutenberg re-issue fails loudly instead of silently reshuffling every golden. Every book must be public domain everywhere, not only in the United States: Gutenberg marks some ebooks as copyrighted, and a translation is only free once its translator's term has run out, so read the header and check the translator before adding one.",
